@@ -68,6 +68,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Navigate controller actions through route namespace attributes.** Per-route namespace modifiers preserve the enclosing controller for completion, hover, references and rename. Namespace groups retain their own controller context. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 - **Compatible Kernel trait registrations.** Middleware navigation preserves complete context for compatible literal class, parent and trait defaults. Reviewed class edits retain every physical declaration; incompatible or unresolved compositions and literal middleware targets remain guarded. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Checked rename across Composer projects.** Unrelated open files no longer prevent PHP Rename. Stale sources and incomplete changes spanning dependent projects remain unavailable. Contributed by @thinkycz.
